<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SoundWave | Privacy Policy</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />

    <%- include('../partials/user/theme-config') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-background-soft" style='font-family:"Space Grotesk","Noto Sans",sans-serif;'>
    <%- include('../partials/user/navbar') %>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-10 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-10">
        <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8 lg:p-10 xl:p-12">
            <nav class="mb-4 flex text-sm text-gray-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                <ol class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-2">
                    <li class="inline-flex items-center">
                        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-500 hover:text-primary">
                            Home
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li aria-current="page">
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-primary">Privacy Policy</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="max-w-6xl space-y-8">
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-primary-light/10 p-5 md:p-6 lg:p-7">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5">
                        <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-primary-light/50 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-primary shadow-sm">
                            <div class="size-4">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M24 45.8096C19.6865 45.8096 15.4698 44.5305 11.8832 42.134C8.29667 39.7376 5.50128 36.3314 3.85056 32.3462C2.19985 28.361 1.76794 23.9758 2.60947 19.7452C3.451 15.5145 5.52816 11.6284 8.57829 8.5783C11.6284 5.52817 15.5145 3.45101 19.7452 2.60948C23.9758 1.76795 28.361 2.19986 32.3462 3.85057C36.3314 5.50129 39.7376 8.29668 42.134 11.8833C44.5305 15.4698 45.8096 19.6865 45.8096 24L24 24L24 45.8096Z" fill="currentColor" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold">SoundWave</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-3">
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary/70">Privacy Policy</p>
                            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">Your account and order information should be handled with care.</h1>
                            <p class="max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
                                This page explains, in simple terms, how SoundWave treats customer information across browsing, ordering, and account-related activity.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-gray-700 md:text-[1.02rem] lg:text-[1.045rem]">
                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Information we use</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">When you create an account, place an order, or interact with the store, we may use the details you provide to support your shopping experience. This can include basic account information, order-related details, and communication needed to help you complete or manage a purchase.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Why we use it</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">We use customer information to keep the storefront functional and useful. That includes helping you sign in, process orders, show relevant account details, support customer service requests, and maintain a smoother shopping experience from browsing to checkout.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">How we treat your data</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">SoundWave aims to handle customer information responsibly. We do not believe in collecting more than we need for the store to work properly, and we do not treat personal information as something to use casually or carelessly.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Sharing and access</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">We do not share customer information unnecessarily. Access to account and order details should only exist where it supports store operations, customer assistance, or the basic functioning of the platform.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Account and shopping security</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">We take the security of customer accounts and shopping activity seriously. That includes protecting access to account-related information and keeping the store experience structured in a way that supports safer browsing, ordering, and account management.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Keeping things practical</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">Our goal is to keep privacy understandable. If we make improvements to the store or adjust how information is used in a meaningful way, we may update this page so it continues to reflect how SoundWave operates.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
